  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside King Quan inheritance on San Cha Mountain, he stands in the fog and waits for the Gu Master walking toward him. He is already forty-eight and has entered this inheritance many times. He rates himself as thriving here, where prior Gu sets do not count and fighters use only what the inheritance supplies. On a prior run he reached the twenty-first barrier, a mark he treats as among the best in his circles and ahead of many rank four upper stage and peak stage Gu Masters.",
      "chapters": [
        347
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_king_quan_inheritance",
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan steps out as little beast king, Han Bu Liu panics, then steadies himself: inside the blessed land only dog enslavement Gu can be used, Fang Yuan walks strength path and is young, and Han Bu Liu judges him weak in enslavement path. He sends eleven dogs in, meaning to take Fang Yuan’s Gu for profit. Fang Yuan answers with nineteen dogs, breaks Han Bu Liu’s formation with an arrow charge and flanking arcs, and seizes control of the fight.",
      "chapters": [
        347
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_dog_enslavement_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "An hour later only Fang Yuan’s dogs remain. Han Bu Liu kneels, begs, and offers lifelong service; Fang Yuan asks for slavery Gu as proof of sincerity, and Han Bu Liu says neither side can use their own Gu worms here and that he has no slavery Gu. Fang Yuan’s dogs tear him apart until the corpse is completely destroyed; Fang Yuan consciously leaves the stomach area intact, then places his palm on the stomach and enters the dying rank four middle stage aperture. He takes five enslavement path Gu including two rank four Gu, and leaves with seven wild dogs after Han Bu Liu’s dying struggle kills the most injured one.",
      "chapters": [
        348
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
